    <informations>Shelly 2.5 — mounting plate, back view.
Terminals, left to right as printed: SW2 O2 L L O1 SW1 N.
Back view: the terminal order is mirrored against the front label face.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-2-5
